[{"id":"m_96a84d66334df578a5d4","expressionId":"x_4b3baa4f4e5850eacd28","language":"ja","text":"『郵便局』","source":"DiQt"},{"id":"m_15e809cb5ded569b58bf","expressionId":"x_34896d2f7c8b29f721f0","language":"ja","text":"銀行勘定,当座預金","source":"DiQt"},{"id":"m_09e8b14257d2eb298743","expressionId":"x_09ad4653b3b7e94e9478","language":"ja","text":"(直接的な原因・理由として)～のために,～のせいで","source":"DiQt"},{"id":"m_6bd4205466140c66cb91","expressionId":"x_0fca39a9b31f4e32d5e6","language":"ja","text":"為替相場","source":"DiQt"},{"id":"m_16d57c2083ba7374dba5","expressionId":"x_f6167337f2938dfe8b8d","language":"ja","text":"...するべきである,...のはずである,...するのは当然である","source":"DiQt"},{"id":"m_b70f188e8d30405056e8","expressionId":"x_3c71f23859ef69503479","language":"ja","text":"パーセント,100につき(…の割),100分(の…)《+of+名》《記号》%;《略》p.c.)  / …パーセントだけ","source":"DiQt"},{"id":"m_8e43a5ed24c94ef8fcc3","expressionId":"x_01efea1d03bb05098cb8","language":"ja","text":"旅行案内(代理)業者","source":"DiQt"},{"id":"m_beeabfd2fb07495adc90","expressionId":"x_f8835a51a60a4e700d3f","language":"ja","text":"感嘆符 =[[exclamation point]]","source":"DiQt"},{"id":"m_f17b657a9dff2190a042","expressionId":"x_1144c6e5491ddc21e179","language":"ja","text":"ハードドライブ,ハードディスクドライブ,固定磁気ディスク装置","source":"DiQt"},{"id":"m_80d1d5a17b7a76ba30d7","expressionId":"x_b5013eb1c1b2db1f7eb9","language":"ja","text":"起こる,行われる / 続く,続ける,を続ける；引き続き...し続ける《to do》","source":"PHaVE"},{"id":"m_03e073047cd5cfb45a76","expressionId":"x_786a16e29494d2abed62","language":"ja","text":"【句動】下を向く,見下ろす / 《...を》見下す《on ...》","source":"PHaVE"},{"id":"m_d9a0292ff8c2195f3308","expressionId":"x_19cee0e17d2a5a7d7689","language":"ja","text":"【句動】（いくつかの中から）を選抜する,を引き抜く,を選び出す / （いくつかの中から）を見つけ出す,を見つける","source":"PHaVE"},{"id":"m_87884fc5ff5fd79cb211","expressionId":"x_ab744831a89931e566f1","language":"ja","text":"【句動】（戦争･火事･乱闘などが〉急に起こる,勃発する","source":"PHaVE"},{"id":"m_dd2019c6248ab727a7d9","expressionId":"x_efb5353e773f5f6028c3","language":"ja","text":"【句動】降りる / 《主語it,all》大切なのは結局...である《to ...》/ （金額・価値が）下がる","source":"PHaVE"},{"id":"m_07588289b7211985bf88","expressionId":"x_bd0b8c4fc2893862c738","language":"ja","text":"【句動】進行する,進めていく / 《...に》同意する ,賛成する《...と》一緒に行く,共に進む《with  ...》/ （非公式に・計画しないで）行く","source":"PHaVE"},{"id":"m_e2304c4880f9a7c8062c","expressionId":"x_f6205788e442b0c33d01","language":"ja","text":"【句動】手を伸ばす, 《...を》得ようとする《for ...》/ 《...に》援助を申し出る, 意思疎通を図ろうとする《to ...","source":"PHaVE"},{"id":"m_8310fccac0ac10aaf32d","expressionId":"x_c7325f5b95d7b944032c","language":"ja","text":"【句動】《...を》思いつく, 考える, 提案する, 生産する《with ...》 / もうすぐ起こる","source":"PHaVE"},{"id":"m_aebee836650e97f7095d","expressionId":"x_316077a8997b6860feb8","language":"ja","text":"【句動】《...に》入居する,引っ越す《to ...》/ 進出する,参入する,進入する","source":"PHaVE"},{"id":"m_d804dd258b6d59cd96a0","expressionId":"x_62e3aeea3c519f20432b","language":"ja","text":"【句動】《...から》（怒り・不満で）出て行く,退席する,退場する；《仕事などを》突然やめる《of ...》","source":"PHaVE"},{"id":"m_8c84cff10bfd6bbe562c","expressionId":"x_9c39b1a2e1d6417a8861","language":"ja","text":"（困難・悪いこと）を経験する / （正式に）承諾される,（公式に議会を）通過する","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_43e902876812c2a9163f","expressionId":"x_b2361bd29736ff8b8d32","language":"ja","text":"少しの,ちょっとの / 《a ...》ちょっとした..., 取るに足りない...","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_a6b8102f09e53f1e023f","expressionId":"x_bead11588ac2eba763c0","language":"ja","text":"《新しいことを》始める,話し合う《to ...》 / 《 ...に》移動する, 《...に》引っ越す《to ...》 / 先に進む / 〈話題など〉変える, 先に進む /  （辛い経験を乗り越えて）精神的に前に進む","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_59a6b60fe40f0f5462f2","expressionId":"x_e2b241ed825864cdab25","language":"ja","text":"《付加》《話》さらに言えば…だ,  / でもよく考えてみると,とはいうものの, しかしまた一方","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_639c2da4a3b315ab3c5e","expressionId":"x_4fb922c1df9800fb971f","language":"ja","text":"向こうへ行く, あっちへ行く / 《…の間 / …へ / …で》当地を離れる《for / to / on ...》/ （問題などが）なくなる","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_66e3ebfaa61569792292","expressionId":"x_9364f3654cddfc80571a","language":"ja","text":"...を視野に入れて, ...を目的として / ...を期待して / 《~ doing》...する目的で","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_0e0b719705f2d4a295f6","expressionId":"x_d70f963c8ebdd41fe7fa","language":"ja","text":"驚くに値しない, ...も不思議ではない, ...も無理はない, なるほど...なわけだ,どうりで...なわけだ,  ...も当然である","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_9e4ed9a2d30b2923c4cb","expressionId":"x_75de3c3c7becd2b27baf","language":"ja","text":"《話》を持っている","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_621b38decd3e4647eec0","expressionId":"x_d5701fc12295d5701467","language":"ja","text":"【句動詞】登場する、出てくる","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_0a26c8fbc72f4e621ba4","expressionId":"x_4e93f1dc7bd9bfba5510","language":"ja","text":"今までのところ, これまでのところ","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_15e68fe47c9c782f59f9","expressionId":"x_bcdb8310eadba0df880b","language":"ja","text":"目下, ちょうど今 / 《過去形と共に》ちょうどその時","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_4e96181040c3020b9e48","expressionId":"x_57e338d2203157bfc7dc","language":"ja","text":"《話》（話の最後で）以上です, それで全部です / 《励まし》いいぞ, その調子 / 《発見》そうそれだ / 《賛意》そうです, その通り / そこが問題なんだ","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_e3c8d224ac1e6dc46d2c","expressionId":"x_f63f7e4275a166e7c735","language":"ja","text":"何よりも（重要なのは）, とりわけ, 中でも","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_c576c1b4bd15f39e965b","expressionId":"x_b0551e2fc2c5acfdb5cd","language":"ja","text":"（考え･計画など）を提案する, を示す, を提出する","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_85a8b34beabb19967f8b","expressionId":"x_a8d31cfb70c17511a564","language":"ja","text":"《be ~》（束縛など）から免れている, ...から解放されている","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_155b0ea0dd8ae298f17c","expressionId":"x_cf84bc80a7e4bfda4f5c","language":"ja","text":"《かたい話》いわば","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_656db889e9f3080ef826","expressionId":"x_5a72c71f998918400d6e","language":"ja","text":"一握りの量の..., 一つかみの量の... / 《くだけて, 通例just/only ~ 》 ほんの少数の..., わずかの...","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_48ed6d089cf05b1425f6","expressionId":"x_52049f1ddd776fc4cb61","language":"ja","text":"ましてそうだ / 《~ than》...よりももっと","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_34b256ef25fb3ce54666","expressionId":"x_2d955a7163f8628f0888","language":"ja","text":"【名】全部, 全員, 全体, すっかり, 一切がっさい","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_65305b97553506b0fd9c","expressionId":"x_2e4bf7dcbc76dc4782b6","language":"ja","text":"バラエティ豊かな, 種類豊富な, 色とりどりの, いろいろな, 寄せ集めの","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_a8c27f568f48be332ffb","expressionId":"x_108ddd9c88c9c8863438","language":"ja","text":"《書》《予定》...することになっていた / 《意志》...するつもりだった / 《運命》...する運命にあった /《義務》...しなければならなかった / 《可能》...できた /","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_7207c8a4b268a0fa6430","expressionId":"x_faf3e9198d32bfc2ffa8","language":"ja","text":"《諦め》まっ, 仕方がないか","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_dad8c41b989cf6549d24","expressionId":"x_f4323a8f754a3a3dd2ef","language":"ja","text":"そういうものとして, それ自体は / 《話》 《not ...》正確（実際）には...などと呼べるものではない","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_12e0de8bea6a4de73a28","expressionId":"x_7ac21fc3fcc6906d39b6","language":"ja","text":"...について, ...に関して / 《文頭で》...はといえば([[as for]]) / （基準･原則）に従って","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_55c10e7eb63a2e7f94ea","expressionId":"x_90a74f47cca779662c74","language":"ja","text":"【形】長期の / 長期にわたって続く, 長期満期の","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_fec81ee421c2f72f951b","expressionId":"x_d98927794af5b99e4dd5","language":"ja","text":"...という結果になる, ...という結果をもたらす, ...という結果につながる, ...という結果に終わる","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_990b39e2cc0c7c2ad029","expressionId":"x_dfbdd9492bec0b1c7ff9","language":"ja","text":"かまわない / 《...にとって》都合がいい《for ...》 / うまくいっている","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_42dd24e6c7cbeab3c6e6","expressionId":"x_c3e0377e35cfa328d16b","language":"ja","text":"【形】…と称する, 自称…の / いわゆる, 世間一般に言われる / そう称されるのは...《because ...》","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_0ecebea094e69ecb8430","expressionId":"x_34360a759d2273f52f1a","language":"ja","text":"《be ~》困窮している, 貧乏している, 困っている","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_5b55cea1bf5ea947e8d7","expressionId":"x_a9da2326876db611add7","language":"ja","text":"...以外は, ...を除いて / （場所・物）の手前で / （事）なしで, ...がなかったら","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_65c4f3d1ec320a995f8e","expressionId":"x_85d958e563aac57de21b","language":"ja","text":"を持ち出す / を育てる","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_ef64563f3d4083aeb3d4","expressionId":"x_45bcb85d486ed9f91e9a","language":"ja","text":"《くだけて》ほとんど, およそ, だいたい / かろうじて, なんとか","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_b220d3098cfd879a7cf5","expressionId":"x_5bbc705de9883b2ddf72","language":"ja","text":"...だとわかる, ...だと判明する《C / to be》","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_474319fbe11c39d334d9","expressionId":"x_7a626b238e8bd9a18422","language":"ja","text":"もう1度, また / ふたたび, 以前のように / 《主に文頭で》またしても, 繰り返して言うが","source":"PHRASE"},{"id":"m_23d9e3a4ba47a25d13b1","expressionId":"x_eab432e03473bccebdfa","language":"ja","text":"『チューインガム』","source":"EJDict"},{"id":"m_74feca83def205af9ac7","expressionId":"x_73ab573aa5953efd10c5","language":"ja","text":"消防署","source":"EJDict"},{"id":"m_5c86e24f3a8bfe7d29e8","expressionId":"x_2badd3ecd2d2ae56dd87","language":"ja","text":"栄養価は低いがカロリーの高い既製食品(ポテトチップ・ポップコーンなど)","source":"EJDict"},{"id":"m_69d0276668d4e1128ebd","expressionId":"x_1dc5bc8b9622abf28aa2","language":"ja","text":"(出勤・退出時の)混雑時間,ラッシュアワー","source":"EJDict"}]